","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_42","text":"Oh, we know. We know very well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_43","text":"But even with that risk,\nwe decided it would be good to kill your Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_44","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_44","text":"But why?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_45","text":"An ordinary commander would never turn their backs to us","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_46","text":"even if we're mixed together with a regular squad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_47","text":"No one would ever risk their life coming up to the Rapture-infested surface","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_48","text":"just to search for a cure for corruption. Not for Nikkes, who are so expendable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_49","text":"But... you're different.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_50","text":"At first, we thought were you just a charlatan, but it wasn't even that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_51","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_51","text":"Crow slowly crouches in front of me","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_Main_16_01","bgArt":"eventscene_main_16_01","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_52","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_52","text":"and smiles. It's impossible to tell what lies behind that smile.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_53","text":"{AccountData.NickName}, you're special.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_54","text":"A great leader like you only comes around once in a century.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_55","text":"But","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_56","text":"having someone like you around throws a wrench into my plans.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_57","text":"Nikkes and humans. outlaws and Sovereigns. The weak and the strong.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_58","text":"Two extremes that can never coexist. Like oil and water.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_59","text":"By sowing dissension amongst their ranks, I will make the Ark destroy itself from the inside.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_60","text":"But someone like you may end up giving them other ideas. I can't have that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_61","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16_13_e_61","text":"*Click*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"IceLand_n","bgArt":"iceland_n","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["jackal","viper","crow","rapi","anis","neon"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16_13_e_62","type":"Speech","sp